# mode's pin assignments, the role and PCIe's PLL calibrations, the USB-C port's transports across sessions and SC7,
# the register writes against the Linux sequences (never a bit of USB2 pad 0 or another lane), LFPS, DFE/CTLE and
# RESET_SSPI messages, the SMMU state the host accepts, U1/U2 off and the moderation floor.
